{
  "title": "nyxGPT / SRE Home",
  "uid": "nyxgpt-sre-home",
  "tags": ["nyxgpt", "sre", "home"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 8,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "nyxGPT SRE Home",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "links": [
        { "title": "Prometheus UI", "url": "http://localhost:9090", "targetBlank": true }
      ],
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "title": "",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 2, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 3 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Deep dive:** [System Overview](/d/nyxgpt-system-overview) · [API Metrics](/d/nyxgpt-api-metrics)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "API up",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "DOWN", "color": "red" } } },
            { "type": "value", "options": { "1": { "text": "UP", "color": "green" } } }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "up{job=\"nyxgpt-api\"}",
          "legendFormat": "up",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Total requests handled",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 4, "x": 4, "y": 5 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(nyxgpt_http_requests_total)",
          "legendFormat": "requests",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "title": "Chat attachments",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "Documents attached via the chat paperclip flow -- a chat feature, not RAG ingestion. This does NOT count toward the RAG ingest panels below.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 4, "x": 8, "y": 5 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(nyxgpt_chat_attachments_total) by (result)",
          "legendFormat": "{{result}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Requests by status",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 11 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(increase(nyxgpt_http_requests_total[$__rate_interval])) by (status)",
          "legendFormat": "status {{status}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "5xx errors",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 11 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(increase(nyxgpt_http_errors_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "5xx errors",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "Request latency (p50 / p95 / p99)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 11 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(nyxgpt_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(nyxgpt_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(nyxgpt_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "title": "",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 2, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 19 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Deep dive:** [RAG Performance](/d/nyxgpt-rag-performance)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "RAG queries by source",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 21 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(increase(nyxgpt_rag_queries_total[$__rate_interval])) by (source)",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "RAG ingests by source and outcome",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 21 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(increase(nyxgpt_rag_ingests_total[$__rate_interval])) by (source, result)",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}} ({{result}})",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "title": "Chat requests (streaming vs. non-streaming)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 21 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(increase(nyxgpt_chat_requests_total[$__rate_interval])) by (streaming)",
          "legendFormat": "streaming={{streaming}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "title": "",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 2, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 29 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Deep dive:** [Resource Usage](/d/nyxgpt-resource-usage)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "title": "Memory (RSS)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 31 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "decmbytes" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "nyxgpt_resource_memory_rss_mb",
          "legendFormat": "RSS",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "title": "CPU usage",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 31 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percent" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "nyxgpt_resource_cpu_percent",
          "legendFormat": "CPU %",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "title": "Cache hit rate by cache",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 31 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percentunit", "min": 0, "max": 1 }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(nyxgpt_cache_requests_total{result=\"hit\"}[5m])) by (cache) / sum(rate(nyxgpt_cache_requests_total[5m])) by (cache)",
          "legendFormat": "{{cache}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "title": "",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 2, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 39 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Deep dive:** [Self-Healing](/d/nyxgpt-self-healing)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Unhealthy components (now)",
      "description": "Snapshot from the last self-heal check pass, not real-time -- see the 'Unhealthy components by name' and 'Self-heal check freshness' panels below for which component(s) and how stale this count is.",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 41 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "nyxgpt_selfheal_unhealthy_components",
          "legendFormat": "unhealthy",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Self-heal restarts (24h)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 4, "x": 4, "y": 41 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(increase(nyxgpt_selfheal_restarts_total[24h]))",
          "legendFormat": "restarts",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "title": "Consecutive restart count by service (backoff state)",
      "type": "bargauge",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 16, "x": 8, "y": 41 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 5 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "nyxgpt_selfheal_restart_count",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "title": "Unhealthy components by name (now)",
      "description": "Names every unhealthy/stopped component this check pass found -- pairs with the bare 'Unhealthy components (now)' count above, which can't say which service it means.",
      "type": "bargauge",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 47 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "unhealthy" }, "1": { "text": "healthy" } } }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "nyxgpt_selfheal_component_healthy",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "title": "Self-heal check freshness",
      "description": "Seconds since the self-heal watchdog's last check pass -- how stale the unhealthy-component panels above are relative to now. Should stay well under the configured check interval; a large/climbing value means the watchdog loop has stalled.",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 47 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "time() - nyxgpt_selfheal_last_check_timestamp",
          "legendFormat": "seconds since last check",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "title": "",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 2, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 53 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Deep dive:** [Canary Rollout](/d/nyxgpt-canary)"
